==English==

===Etymology===
From late 19th century.  From {{uder|en|grc|ἐρωτικός||related to love}}, which is from {{m|grc|ἔρως||passionate or sexual love}}; {{confix|en|eroto|mania}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|en|eɪniə|s=6}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|-|s}}

# A [[disorder]] in which a person has a [[delusion]] of a romantic relationship with another person.
# Excessive sexual [[inclination]] or [[desire]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|de Clérambault's syndrome}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|en|erotomane}}

